- distributor or integrator margin;
- legal and security review;
- procurement delay and working-capital requirements.

The company should calculate contribution margin after these costs, not merely software gross margin.

## 5.2 Packaging by customer

### Families

- free or low-cost diagnostic;
- monthly and annual subscription;
- multiple-child plan;
